       "marks": [
        "em"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "en": [
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0043",
     "style": "normal",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0044",
       "text": "At the 2025 Unbound Gravel 200 (322 km), Keegan Swenson caught everyone's attention by racing on ",
       "marks": []
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0045",
       "text": "wheels fitted with two valves.",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0046",
     "style": "normal",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0047",
       "text": "Swenson and his teammate Tobin Ortenblad built the wheels themselves, drilling an extra hole in the rim so a spare inner tube could sit inside the tubeless tyre. The first valve serves the tubeless setup; the second is connected to the spare tube.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0048",
     "style": "normal",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0049",
       "text": "If a tyre suffered a major puncture that sealant couldn't fix, they could simply inflate the spare tube without removing the tyre or swapping the wheel – saving time and staying in the race.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0050",
     "style": "h2",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0051",
       "text": "The setup: a rider-made invention",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0052",
     "style": "normal",
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "level": 1,
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0053",
       "text": "This was a ",
       "marks": []
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0054",
       "text": "personal idea",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0055",
       "text": " from Keegan Swenson and teammate Tobin Ortenblad.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0056",
     "style": "normal",
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "level": 1,
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0057",
       "text": "They ",
       "marks": []
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0058",
       "text": "drilled an extra hole in the rim",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0059",
       "text": " for the second valve and placed a spare tube inside the tubeless tyre.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0060",
     "style": "normal",
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "level": 1,
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0061",
       "text": "The wheel sponsor (Reserve) ",
       "marks": []
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0062",
       "text": "does not offer",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0063",
       "text": " this system. It is a fully \"DIY\" creation by the riders, based on racing experience and the need to handle real-world problems.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "figure",
     "_key": "k0069",
     "url": "/media/ZwXayFYMA1CFMpKVdw5DWxKNNwDTEhCn3tir3uR3.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "caption": ""
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0064",
     "style": "h2",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0065",
       "text": "Smart tactics for a brutal race",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0066",
     "style": "normal",
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "level": 1,
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0067",
       "text": "Unbound Gravel",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0068",
       "text": " is one of the toughest off-road races, with sharp rocks, dirty roads and plenty of mechanical risks.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0069",
     "style": "normal",
     "listItem": "bullet",
     "level": 1,
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0070",
       "text": "Carrying a spare tube inside the tyre from the start let Keegan ",
       "marks": []
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0071",
       "text": "prepare for every scenario",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0072",
       "text": ", saving time if something went wrong.",
