      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0075",
       "text": "didn't need the spare tube",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0076",
       "text": " during the race, having the option gave him confidence and the ability to react quickly.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0077",
     "style": "normal",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0078",
       "text": "Keegan Swenson's two-valve wheels at Unbound Gravel 2025 are a creative answer to tyre failures in harsh race conditions. Although the spare tube went unused, the preparation shows how much it pays to anticipate the unexpected in sport.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
