     "alt": "",
     "caption": ""
    },
    {
     "_type": "figure",
     "_key": "k0137",
     "url": "/media/grD2doBjEqXhz9X3CpmJXflZtFCYlXE7gNPKDBNt.jpg",
     "alt": "",
     "caption": ""
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0129",
     "style": "normal",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0130",
       "text": "Nguồn: Vital MTB",
       "marks": [
        "em"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "en": [
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0131",
     "style": "normal",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0132",
       "text": "Adam Miller, the founder of Revel Bikes, has bought back all of the assets of the company he started, returning the brand to independent ownership. The move follows a difficult period for Revel amid major turbulence in the mountain bike market.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0133",
     "style": "normal",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0134",
       "text": "Miller says he wants to take Revel back to its roots: a focus on product quality and innovation rather than growth at any cost. He has committed to rebuilding the company at a smaller but more sustainable scale, putting customers and the riding community first.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0135",
     "style": "normal",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0136",
       "text": "The buy-back is more than the return of a brand – it is a symbol of entrepreneurial spirit and the relentless passion that drives the bike industry.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "block",
     "_key": "m0137",
     "style": "normal",
     "markDefs": [],
     "children": [
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "m0138",
       "text": "Revel Bikes is known for high-quality mountain bikes with refined design and outstanding performance. Adam Miller's return promises innovative products and a better experience for riders in the times ahead.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "figure",
